n a blue light is used, the ammeter shows the formation of current.</p>\n<p>E. When a white light is used. the ammeter shows formation of current.</p>\n<p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" B, C and D Only\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" A, C, D and E Only\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":" A, B, D and E Only\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":" A, D and E Only"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>To determine the correct statements regarding the threshold frequency of cesium, first note that the threshold frequency given is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.931ex\" height=\"2.425ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 6157.6 1071.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2000.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3000.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4790.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4957.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Using this frequency, we can calculate the corresponding wavelength, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, using the equation:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.353ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.37ex\" height=\"3.824ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1092.4 8561.7 1690.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(238.4,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><rect width=\"542.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2977.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4033.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(584.7,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(2714.6,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2950.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">m/s</text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-456.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2556,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(4346.1,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4582.3,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g><rect width=\"4288.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This calculation gives <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.714ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6061.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2248\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2248\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4694.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4861.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">nm</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Key points:</p>\n\n<p><p>The wavelength calculated is near the yellow light region. Therefore, yellow light has enough energy to cause a photoelectric effect.</p></p>\n<p><p>When the intensity of light (brightness) decreases, the photocurrent will also decrease, as fewer photons are available to eject electrons.</p></p>\n<p><p>Red light, with its larger wavelength and lower frequency, does not have enough energy to cause the photoelectric effect in cesium.</p></p>\n<p><p>Blue light has a higher frequency than yellow light (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.186ex\" height=\"1.942ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -540 6712.2 858.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">blue</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2542.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3598.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">yellow</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), meaning it can produce a photoelectric current.</p></p>\n<p><p>White light includes all visible frequencies, including those above the threshold, so it will also emit a current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the correct statements involve using yellow, blue, and white light, without producing an effect with red light:</p>\n\n<p><p>A: Yellow light produces a current.</p></p>\n<p><p>B: Dimming yellow light reduces the current.</p></p>\n<p><p>D: Blue light produces a current.</p></p>\n<p><p>E: White light produces a current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct statements are A, B, D, and E.</p>"},"hi":{"direction":null,"comprehension":null,"content":"<p><img src=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png\" data-orsrc=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;display:block;margin:0 auto;max-height:40vh;vertical-align:baseline\" alt=\"JEE Main 2025 (Online) 7th April Morning Shift Chemistry - Structure of Atom Question 32 Hindi\" srcset=\"https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/500/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/750/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 750w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1000/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 1000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/1500/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 1500w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2000/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 2000w, https://app-content.cdn.examgoal.net/fly/2500/image/jaoe38c1m9i3i01z/2c3faa4f-e067-4994-b685-dd32a615928d/25b14d70-19bf-11f0-84b6-3da9fe0b3bef/file-jaoe38c1m9i3i020.webp?format=png 2500w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 767px) 100vw, 720px\" decoding=\"async\"></p>\n<p>यदि सीजियम की देहली आवृति <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14.897ex\" height=\"2.425ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 6584.6 1071.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2000.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3000.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(4790.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\"> </text></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(600,0)\"><use data-c=\"48\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-48\"></use><use data-c=\"7A\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-7A\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> है तो निम्नलिखित में से कौन से कथन सही हैं?</p>\n<p>A. जब Cs को इससे संयोजित धारामापी के साथ एक निर्वातित प्रकोष्ठ में रखकर इस पर पीले प्रकाश को फोकस किया जाता है, तो धारामापी धारा की उपस्थिती दर्शाता है।</p>\n<p>B. पीले प्रकाश के प्रभासन को जब हल्का किया जाता है, धारामापी में धारा का मान घट जाता है।</p>\n<p>C. पीले प्रकाश के स्थान पर जब लाल प्रकाश का प्रयोग किया जाता हे, तो पीले प्रकाश के सन्दर्भ में उत्पन्न धारा उच्चतर होती है।</p>\n<p>D. जब एक नीले प्रकाश का प्रयोग किया जाता है, तो धारामापी धारा के निर्माण को दर्शाता है।</p>\n<p>E. जब एक सफेद प्रकाश का प्रयोग किया जाता है, तो धारामापी धारा के निर्माण को दर्शाता है।</p>\n<p>नीचे दिए गए विकल्पों में से सही उत्तर चुनें:</p>","options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" केवल B, C और D\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" केवल <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.439ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.071ex\" height=\"2.059ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -716 3125.3 910\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"41\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-41\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(750,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(1194.7,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"43\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-43\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1916.7,0)\"><use data-c=\"2C\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2C\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\" transform=\"translate(2361.3,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"44\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-44\"></use></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> और E\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":" केवल A, B, D और E\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":" केवल A, D और E"}],"correct_options":["C"],"answer":null,"explanation":"<p>सीज़ियम की देहली आवृत्ति के संबंध में सही कथनों को निर्धारित करने के लिए, पहले ध्यान दें कि दी गई देहली आवृत्ति <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.931ex\" height=\"2.425ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 6157.6 1071.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2000.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3000.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4790.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4957.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> है। इस आवृत्ति का उपयोग करके, हम संगत तरंगदैर्ध्य, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, की गणना समीकरण का उपयोग करके कर सकते हैं:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.353ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.37ex\" height=\"3.824ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1092.4 8561.7 1690.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(238.4,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-