<g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(4346.1,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4582.3,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g><rect width=\"4288.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>यह गणना <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.714ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6061.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2248\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2248\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4694.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4861.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">nm</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> देती है।</p>\n<p>मुख्य बिंदु:</p>\n\n<p><p>गणना की गई तरंगदैर्ध्य पीले प्रकाश क्षेत्र के निकट है। इसलिए, पीले प्रकाश में प्रकाश विद्युत प्रभाव उत्पन्न करने के लिए पर्याप्त ऊर्जा है।</p></p>\n<p><p>जब प्रकाश की तीव्रता (चमक) कम होती है, तो प्रकाश धारा भी कम हो जाएगी, क्योंक�� इलेक्ट्रॉनों को बाहर निकालने के लिए कम फोटॉन उपलब्ध होते हैं।</p></p>\n<p><p>लाल प्रकाश, अपनी बड़ी तरंगदैर्ध्य और कम आवृत्ति के साथ, सीज़ियम में प्रकाश विद्युत प्रभाव उत्पन्न करने के लिए पर्याप्त ऊर्जा नहीं रखता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>नीले प्रकाश की आवृत्ति पीले प्रकाश से अधिक है (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.186ex\" height=\"1.942ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -540 6712.2 858.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">blue</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2542.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3598.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">yellow</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), जिसका अर्थ है कि यह प्रकाश विद्युत धारा उत्पन्न कर सकता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>श्वेत प्रकाश में देहली से ऊपर की आवृत्तियों सहित सभी दृश्य आवृत्तियाँ शामिल हैं, इसलिए यह भी धारा उत्सर्जित करेगा।</p></p>\n\n<p>इस प्रकार, सही कथनों में पीले, नीले और श्वेत प्रकाश का उपयोग शामिल है, लाल प्रकाश के साथ कोई प्रभाव उत्पन्न किए बिना:</p>\n\n<p><p>A: पीला प्रकाश धारा उत्पन्न करता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>B: पीले प्रकाश को मंद करना धारा को कम करता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>D: नीला प्रकाश धारा उत्पन्न करता है।</p></p>\n<p><p>E: श्वेत प्रकाश धारा उत्पन्न करता है।</p></p>\n\n<p>इसलिए, सही कथन A, B, D और E हैं।</p>"}},"subject":"chemistry","timeAllotted":144000,"topic":"photoelectric-effect","type":"mcq","year":2025,"isOutOfSyllabus":false,"isBonus":false,"tags":["multi_statements"],"yearKey":"jee-main-2025-online-7th-april-morning-shift","active":true,"options":[{"identifier":"A","content":" B, C and D Only\n"},{"identifier":"B","content":" A, C, D and E Only\n"},{"identifier":"C","content":" A, B, D and E Only\n"},{"identifier":"D","content":" A, D and E Only"}],"correct_options":["C"],"explanation":"<p>To determine the correct statements regarding the threshold frequency of cesium, first note that the threshold frequency given is <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.931ex\" height=\"2.425ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -871.8 6157.6 1071.8\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2000.2,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(3000.4,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4790.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4957.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>. Using this frequency, we can calculate the corresponding wavelength, <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.027ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.319ex\" height=\"1.597ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -694 583 706\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>, using the equation:</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.353ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"19.37ex\" height=\"3.824ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1092.4 8561.7 1690.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(238.4,394) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D450\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D450\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mi\" transform=\"translate(220,-345) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><rect width=\"542.9\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2977.3,0)\"><use data-c=\"3D\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3D\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mfrac\" transform=\"translate(4033.1,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(584.7,481.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\"><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(2714.6,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(2950.7,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">m/s</text></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mrow\" transform=\"translate(220,-456.4) scale(0.707)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"36\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-36\" transform=\"translate(1278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"><use data-c=\"D7\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-D7\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msup\" transform=\"translate(2556,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"30\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-30\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(1033,393.1) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mn\"><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\"></use><use data-c=\"34\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-34\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mstyle\" transform=\"translate(4346.1,0) scale(1.414)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\"></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4582.3,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">Hz</text></g></g><rect width=\"4288.7\" height=\"60\" x=\"120\" y=\"220\"></rect></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>This calculation gives <mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.452ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13.714ex\" height=\"2.149ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -750 6061.6 950\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D706\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D706\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(860.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"2248\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2248\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mn\" transform=\"translate(1916.6,0)\"><use data-c=\"35\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-35\"></use><use data-c=\"38\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-38\" transform=\"translate(500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"31\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-31\" transform=\"translate(1000,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"2E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2E\" transform=\"translate(1500,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"33\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-33\" transform=\"translate(1778,0)\"></use><use data-c=\"39\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-39\" transform=\"translate(2278,0)\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"mspace\" transform=\"translate(4694.6,0)\"></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\" transform=\"translate(4861.6,0)\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">nm</text></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>.</p>\n<p>Key points:</p>\n\n<p><p>The wavelength calculated is near the yellow light region. Therefore, yellow light has enough energy to cause a photoelectric effect.</p></p>\n<p><p>When the intensity of light (brightness) decreases, the photocurrent will also decrease, as fewer photons are available to eject electrons.</p></p>\n<p><p>Red light, with its larger wavelength and lower frequency, does not have enough energy to cause the photoelectric effect in cesium.</p></p>\n<p><p>Blue light has a higher frequency than yellow light (<mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.72ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"15.186ex\" height=\"1.942ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -540 6712.2 858.2\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"msub\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">blue</text></g></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mo\" transform=\"translate(2542.8,0)\"><use data-c=\"3E\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-3E\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"msub\" transform=\"translate(3598.6,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mi\"><use data-c=\"1D463\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-I-1D463\"></use></g><g data-mml-node=\"TeXAtom\" transform=\"translate(518,-176.7) scale(0.707)\" data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtext\" style=\"font-family: Roboto,'Tiro Devanagari Hindi','Tiro Bangla',sans-serif;\"><text data-variant=\"-explicitFont\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\" font-size=\"884px\">yellow</text></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container>), meaning it can produce a photoelectric current.</p></p>\n<p><p>White light includes all visible frequencies, including those above the threshold, so it will also emit a current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Thus, the correct statements involve using yellow, blue, and white light, without producing an effect with red light:</p>\n\n<p><p>A: Yellow light produces a current.</p></p>\n<p><p>B: Dimming yellow light reduces the current.</p></p>\n<p><p>D: Blue light produces a current.</p></p>\n<p><p>E: White light produces a current.</p></p>\n\n<p>Therefore, the correct statements are A, B, D, and E.</p>"}]}